ists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-07T04:16:37Z","updated_at":"2023-09-07T04:21:47Z","body":"@jlovejoy it is not a match to HPND: Excerpt:\r\n```\r\n<p>Permission to use, copy, modify and distribute this software and its documentation for any purpose and\r\n         without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above copyright notice appear in all copies<optional spacing=\"after\">,</optional>\r\n         <optional>and</optional> that both <optional>that</optional>\r\n         <optional>the</optional> copyright notice\r\n         and this permission notice appear in supporting documentation<optional>, and that the name <optional>of</optional>\r\n            <alt match=\".*\" name=\"copyrightHolder0\">&lt;copyright holder&gt;</alt>\r\n            <alt match=\".*\" name=\"orRelated\">&lt;or related entities&gt;</alt>\r\n         not be used in advertising or publicity pertaining to distribution of the software without specific, written\r\n         prior permission</optional>. \r\n         <optional><alt match=\".*\" name=\"copyrightHolder1\">&lt;copyright holder&gt;</alt> \r\n         makes no representations about the suitability of this software for any purpose. \r\n         <alt match=\"It|This software\" name=\"subject\">It</alt> \r\n         is provided \"as is\" without express or implied warranty.</optional>\r\n      </p>\r\n```\r\n\r\nSpecifically, one problem at least is that this license has the first sentence end in \". . . appear in all copies.\" `HPND` as defined in the referenced XML file does not. For the same reason it does not fit within the [template](https://opensource.org/license/historical-php/) that the OSI uses for HPND.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1709450310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1711032195","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2075#issuecomment-1711032195","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2075","id":1711032195,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85l_EeD","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-08T03:43:12Z","updated_at":"2023-09-08T03:43:12Z","body":"I realized that the license matching tools don't do a good job of matching to HPND (and its variants) b/c there is so much that 